          "text": "```xml\n<mujoco model=\"pendulum_four_ball_transfer\">\n  <compiler angle=\"radian\" inertiafromgeom=\"true\"/>\n  <option timestep=\"0.002\" gravity=\"0 0 -9.81\" integrator=\"implicitfast\" cone=\"elliptic\" iterations=\"80\" tolerance=\"1e-10\"/>\n\n  <visual>\n    <headlight ambient=\"0.35 0.35 0.35\" diffuse=\"0.7 0.7 0.7\" specular=\"0.2 0.2 0.2\"/>\n  </visual>\n\n  <worldbody>\n    <light name=\"overhead\" pos=\"0 -2 4\" dir=\"0 0 -1\"/>\n    <camera name=\"overview\" pos=\"0.5 -3 1.8\" xyaxes=\"1 0 0 0 0.45 0.893\"/>\n\n    <geom name=\"floor\" type=\"plane\" pos=\"0 0 0\" size=\"3 2 0.1\" friction=\"0.8 0.005 0.001\" priority=\"2\" solref=\"0.008 1\" rgba=\"0.22 0.25 0.28 1\"/>\n    <geom name=\"pivot_marker\" type=\"sphere\" pos=\"0 0 1.14\" size=\"0.025\" contype=\"0\" conaffinity=\"0\" rgba=\"0.25 0.25 0.28 1\"/>\n\n    <!-- The bob is 1 m below its hinge. At 60 degrees its release height\n         is 1*(1-cos(60 degrees)) = 0.5 m above its lowest point. -->\n    <body name=\"pendulum\" pos=\"0 0 1.14\">\n      <joint name=\"pendulum_hinge\" type=\"hinge\" axis=\"0 1 0\" limited=\"false\" damping=\"0.0005\"/>\n      <geom name=\"pendulum_rod\" type=\"capsule\" fromto=\"0 0 0 0 0 -0.96\" size=\"0.006\" mass=\"0.0005\" contype=\"0\" conaffinity=\"0\" rgba=\"0.65 0.68 0.72 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"pendulum_bob\" type=\"sphere\" pos=\"0 0 -1\" size=\"0.04\" mass=\"0.2\" condim=\"6\" friction=\"0.03 0.001 0.001\" solref=\"-100000 -20\" solimp=\"0.98 0.995 0.001\" rgba=\"0.9 0.45 0.12 1\"/>\n    </body>\n\n    <!-- Level rail: top surface z=0.10, with lateral guides. -->\n    <body name=\"rail\" pos=\"0 0 0\">\n      <geom name=\"rail_bed\" type=\"box\" pos=\"0.325 0 0.05\" size=\"0.475 0.08 0.05\" priority=\"1\" condim=\"6\" friction=\"0.03 0.001 0.001\" solref=\"0.008 1\" solimp=\"0.95 0.99 0.001\" rgba=\"0.42 0.46 0.50 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rail_left_guide\" type=\"box\" pos=\"0.325 0.09 0.16\" size=\"0.475 0.01 0.06\" priority=\"1\" condim=\"6\" friction=\"0.03 0.001 0.001\" solref=\"0.008 1\" solimp=\"0.95 0.99 0.001\" rgba=\"0.3 0.34 0.38 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rail_right_guide\" type=\"box\" pos=\"0.325 -0.09 0.16\" size=\"0.475 0.01 0.06\" priority=\"1\" condim=\"6\" friction=\"0.03 0.001 0.001\" solref=\"0.008 1\" solimp=\"0.95 0.99 0.001\" rgba=\"0.3 0.34 0.38 1\"/>\n    </body>\n\n    <!-- Four equal balls, initially at rest, with 0.15 m center spacing.\n         Their mutually contacting surfaces use lightly damped contacts. -->\n    <body name=\"ball1\" pos=\"0.08 0 0.14\">\n      <freejoint name=\"ball1_free\"/>\n      <geom name=\"ball1_sphere\" type=\"sphere\" size=\"0.04\" mass=\"0.2\" condim=\"6\" friction=\"0.03 0.001 0.001\" solref=\"-100000 -20\" solimp=\"0.98 0.995 0.001\" rgba=\"0.85 0.18 0.16 1\"/>\n    </body>\n\n    <body name=\"ball2\" pos=\"0.23 0 0.14\">\n      <freejoint name=\"ball2_free\"/>\n      <geom name=\"ball2_sphere\" type=\"sphere\" size=\"0.04\" mass=\"0.2\" condim=\"6\" friction=\"0.03 0.001 0.001\" solref=\"-100000 -20\" solimp=\"0.98 0.995 0.001\" rgba=\"0.95 0.65 0.12 1\"/>\n    </body>\n\n    <body name=\"ball3\" pos=\"0.38 0 0.14\">\n      <freejoint name=\"ball3_free\"/>\n      <geom name=\"ball3_sphere\" type=\"sphere\" size=\"0.04\" mass=\"0.2\" condim=\"6\" friction=\"0.03 0.001 0.001\" solref=\"-100000 -20\" solimp=\"0.98 0.995 0.001\" rgba=\"0.15 0.65 0.32 1\"/>\n    </body>\n\n    <body name=\"ball4\" pos=\"0.53 0 0.14\">\n      <freejoint name=\"ball4_free\"/>\n      <geom name=\"ball4_sphere\" type=\"sphere\" size=\"0.04\" mass=\"0.2\" condim=\"6\" friction=\"0.03 0.001 0.001\" solref=\"-100000 -20\" solimp=\"0.98 0.995 0.001\" rgba=\"0.15 0.4 0.9 1\"/>\n    </body>\n\n    <!-- The entrance lip is flush with the rail. Beyond it, the ball\n         drops into a lower, high-friction pocket with damped walls. -->\n    <body name=\"box\" pos=\"1.02 0 0\">\n      <geom name=\"box_bottom\" type=\"box\" pos=\"0 0 0.0075\" size=\"0.24 0.15 0.0075\" priority=\"2\" condim=\"6\" friction=\"1 0.005 0.02\" solref=\"0.008 1\" solimp=\"0.95 0.99 0.001\" rgba=\"0.48 0.32 0.18 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"box_front_lip\" type=\"box\" pos=\"-0.21 0 0.05\" size=\"0.01 0.15 0.05\" priority=\"2\" condim=\"6\" friction=\"1 0.005 0.02\" solref=\"0.008 1\" solimp=\"0.95 0.99 0.001\" rgba=\"0.58 0.4 0.23 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"box_back_wall\" type=\"box\" pos=\"0.22 0 0.125\" size=\"0.02 0.15 0.125\" priority=\"2\" condim=\"6\" friction=\"1 0.005 0.02\" solref=\"0.008 1\" solimp=\"0.95 0.99 0.001\" rgba=\"0.58 0.4 0.23 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"box_left_wall\" type=\"box\" pos=\"0 0.135 0.125\" size=\"0.24 0.015 0.125\" priority=\"2\" condim=\"6\" friction=\"1 0.005 0.02\" solref=\"0.008 1\" solimp=\"0.95 0.99 0.001\" rgba=\"0.58 0.4 0.23 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"box_right_wall\" type=\"box\" pos=\"0 -0.135 0.125\" size=\"0.24 0.015 0.125\" priority=\"2\" condim=\"6\" friction=\"1 0.005 0.02\" solref=\"0.008 1\" solimp=\"0.95 0.99 0.001\" rgba=\"0.58 0.4 0.23 1\"/>\n    </body>\n  </worldbody>\n\n  <keyframe>\n    <key name=\"start\" qpos=\"1.047197551196598 0.08 0 0.14 1 0 0 0 0.23 0 0.14 1 0 0 0 0.38 0 0.14 1 0 0 0 0.53 0 0.14 1 0 0 0\"/>\n  </keyframe>\n</mujoco>\n```",
